WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,700
Something to be proud of

2
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:14,060
I still won my bet today a few days ago

3
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:17,100
I guessed it when Meng Xilan called me

4
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,300
She wants to use Meng Xilan to affect my reputation

5
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,900
I took the opportunity to agree to Song Jingyu’s request for reconciliation.

6
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,900
It will definitely make Song Jingyu think more

7
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,940
It really ruined my image in front of Liuli

8
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,300
Meng Xilan appeared as I expected

9
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,180
I didn't stop Meng Xilan on purpose

10
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,460
The feud at the banquet

11
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,860
But when giving Meng Xilan a necklace

12
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,820
Stuffed a note into her palm

13
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,800
She didn't get a chance to read the note at first

14
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,080
Finally, I deliberately delayed saying that I needed to go to the toilet.

15
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,200
I finally saw my message

16
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,360
So she deliberately hid nearby and eavesdropped

17
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,600
Only then did I know everything

18
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,160
I said your mother is always

19
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:51,040
hanging between men

20
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,400
raise you up

21
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,680
So you may have ears and eyes stained

22
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,840
learned something
